      "content": "okay, i hear you. the \"synergy\" angle sounds like a good pivot for the lawyers. \n\nhonestly though, i'm a little nervous that if the patent examiner sees the overlap with 7,889,001, they'll just reject the whole thing and we'll waste a huge amount of money on legal fees. realistically, if you had to bet, do you think our chances of getting this approved on the first pass are actually good? i need to tell the board if this is a safe bet or if we're walking into a trap.",
